                                "sense_id": "59c6c5ae-53f4-3609-bc47-0a9ae19853b4",
                                "text": "She was so absorbed in her book that she didn’t hear the phone."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "902937a3-5532-4e35-9191-10b1a240aa72",
                                "sense_id": "59c6c5ae-53f4-3609-bc47-0a9ae19853b4",
                                "text": "The scientist remained absorbed in his experiments."
